    },
    "EquipmentRerollHeadDetailsGate": {
        "desc": "详情已打开，按模式分流", // [Anchor] 去向由任务模式决定：扫描流程指向 ScanBegin*，洗词条流程由 EquipmentRerollValueDecide 改指 LockGate
